  <!-- EN: field launch position -->
  <DMSE_FieldLaunchSite.label>野戰發射陣地</DMSE_FieldLaunchSite.label>
  <!-- EN: A rapidly deployed field missile position fielded by an industrial-era faction: a search radar, scattered launch positions, ammunition carriers and crew shelters. Supply pods keep the garrison fed for as long as its radars stay operational. -->
  <DMSE_FieldLaunchSite.description>一處由工業等級派系快速部署的野戰導彈陣地，配備搜索雷達、分散的發射陣位、彈藥車與人員休息區。只要雷達仍在運作，補給艙就會持續為守軍送來食物。</DMSE_FieldLaunchSite.description>
  
</LanguageData>